Entrar na pasta:
cd /home/pi/automation/configs-apps/app-finance-sync

Instalar dependências:
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt

Gerar o JSON:
python convert_finance_xlsx_to_json.py /DATA/Documents/2026contas.xlsx --output finance-data.json
Arquivo gerado: finance-data.json

Subir o container:
docker compose -f /home/pi/automation/dc-local/dc-finan-dashboard.yaml up -d

Acessar:
http://<IP-do-raspberry>:8085


## backup

sudo cp finance.conf.example /etc/finance-backup.conf
sudo nano /etc/finance-backup.conf
sudo cp finance-backup.sh /usr/local/bin/
sudo chmod +x /usr/local/bin/finance-backup.sh